From 8a91530e5c93221b5510b191d779d65848b95bd3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: forest <forest@localhost>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 17:36:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] repo: split commit formatting from signing

formatUnsignedCommit and formatUnsignedInitCommit return everything a
commit is before its signature; finalizeCommit attaches a signed commit
and adds its block. formatCommit and formatInitCommit are the same two
steps with a local keypair in between, so nothing upstream changes
shape or bytes. A key that is not on this machine can now sign the same
bytes and the repo rebuilds the commit around the signature.
---
 packages/repo/src/repo.ts  | 108 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++-----------
 packages/repo/src/types.ts |  16 ++++++
 2 files changed, 94 insertions(+), 30 deletions(-)

diff --git a/packages/repo/src/repo.ts b/packages/repo/src/repo.ts
index 9f90923..0ff3590 100644
